  Cell["This legacy helper collects, sorts and deduplicates SpinorChain \
objects occurring inside the supplied expression. It emits C++ text, not \
declarations of the particle objects.", "Notes"],
  Cell["Use a containing expression or a list when processing a single bare \
chain; the helper searches subexpressions rather than the top-level head.",
   "Notes"], Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Load HEPCAT", "ExampleSubsection"],
